{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "spanish", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1730419200, "end_date": 1731110399, "month_true_total": 898, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:31:40 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "178648899", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076346617", "personaname": "ElpotroSalvaje", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198076346617/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 13658, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 182, "playtime_at_review": 1749, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1192, "last_played": 1787975515, "avatar": "15694a59684bcb5018c7dba0f194319ca04e6b8e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "buena onda de juego", "timestamp_created": 1731108810, "timestamp_updated": 1731108810, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178640472", "author": {"steamid": "76561198893962438", "personaname": "ROUTERenp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198893962438/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 160988, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 7443, "playtime_at_review": 41286, "last_played": 1788042667, "avatar": "b603140f9e1c8c97127bf6d60484ba9995e8c5c4"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "esta guapo", "timestamp_created": 1731098367, "timestamp_updated": 1731098367, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178638708", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150370945", "personaname": "DonArgentino", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198150370945/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 95920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 673, "playtime_at_review": 91577, "last_played": 1787956236, "avatar": "f8437dc7938d9d61c1ec8e517bb5b61667921a65"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "The game is a lot of fun, and the developers listen to their community.\nIt has many add-ons in the form of Warbonds, which are expensive. However, you can farm the money to buy them; you just have to be consistent, spending 20-30 minutes a day for about 10-15 days, or sitting down one afternoon to do it. Also, you don't really need to have them all. Four or five are enough to play the game smoothly with the best options.\nThe player community is friendly and willing to help if you ask for assistance on Discord. I bought this game the second week after it came out, and since then they've improved it a lot in terms of gameplay, battle environments, enemy factions, and the evolution of their soldiers. I reached the maximum level a long time ago, over a year, and I also have all the Warbonds. \nThere are some bugs and crashes, from what I've read, but nothing that can't be fixed. The developers are present and address issues. They also regularly conduct polls on their Discord server to gather feedback.\nMy only criticism is the aesthetics, as I'd like the experience to be reflected in the ranks you earn. \nIt's a simple game that provides enjoyment while you play it.", "timestamp_created": 1731096464, "timestamp_updated": 1776963868, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178595744", "author"